## Project Structure

```
foodcoupon/                        ← project root
│
├── manage.py
├── requirements.txt
├── .env                           ← your secrets (never commit this)
├── db.sqlite3                     ← auto-created after migrate
│
├── Dockerfile                     ← for server deployment
├── docker-compose.yml             ← for server deployment
├── nginx/
│   └── nginx.conf                 ← for server deployment
│
├── foodcoupon/                    ← Django project config
│   ├── __init__.py
│   ├── settings.py
│   ├── urls.py
│   └── wsgi.py
│
└── students/                      ← main app
    ├── __init__.py
    ├── admin.py
    ├── apps.py
    ├── models.py
    ├── views.py
    ├── urls.py
    ├── templates/
    │   └── students/
    │       └── scanner.html       ← volunteer scanner UI
    └── management/
        └── commands/
            ├── __init__.py
            ├── import_students.py ← run once to load CSV
            └── send_qr_emails.py  ← run night before fest
```

