```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐
│         FOOD COUPON SCANNER             │
│                                         │
│  URL: http://192.168.1.XX:8000          │
│                                         │
│  GREEN  ✅  = Give food, mark done      │
│  RED    ❌  = Already eaten, reject     │
│  YELLOW ❓  = Not in system, check USN  │
│                                         │
│  If QR doesn't scan → use USN tab       │
│  Stats: /api/stats/                     │
│  Admin: /admin  (for issues only)       │
└─────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

