## Built With

- [Django 4.2](https://www.djangoproject.com/) — backend framework
- [qrcode](https://pypi.org/project/qrcode/) — QR code generation
- [html5-qrcode](https://github.com/mebjas/html5-qrcode) — browser camera scanner
- [Tailwind CSS](https://tailwindcss.com/) — volunteer UI styling
- SQLite — database (sufficient for 600 students)